    "name": "Maggy Lowther. JBa.10",
    "abc": "X:10\nT:Maggy Lowther. JBa.10\nT:Maggy Lowder,aka. JBa.10\nT:Maggie Lauder,aka. JBa.10\nM:4/4\nL:1/8\nQ:1/4=80\nS:Joseph Barnes MS,Carlisle,1762.\nR:Air\nO:England\nA:North-West - Carlisle\nN:No time signature,no key signature, number of beats in a bar very\nN:variable.  Time signature chosen because I have to put something  in.\nN:Key signature because the begining of this appears to be a relative\nN:of the song  (see Maggie Lauder in J.Aird,HSJJackson)\nN:Other than that, transcribed as written because otherwise it would  not\nN:be\nN:editing,   it would be rewriting.\nN:Actually it makes a lot of sense if you play it. Numbers at begining of\nN:sections are given in MS.  NB - Does the handwriting change here\nN:NB# - impossible to tell duration...CGr\nZ:vmp.Cherri Graebe\nB:Village Music project, Barnes, Joseph\n%%Mirrorred-From:http://www.village-music-project.org.uk/abc/barnes_j.abc\nnotC:unedited\nK:D major\n\nA2 | d>fd>f  d>ed>f | ef g/f/e/d/ c2 e2 |\\\nd>ed>f  d>ed>f | a/b/ abag f2a2 |!\ng>ag>b f>g f>a |  e/f/ gfed |  c2 e2 |\\\nd/c/B/A/ B/A/G/F/ G/F/E/D/| Dg (fg)a ef d2 D ||!\n f/g/a da fga dfef f/e/d/c/ c2e2 |\\\nf/g/a d2a2 f/g/a df/g/ |a/g/a/b/ a/b/a/g/ f2a2 |!\ng/f/g/a/ a/b/a/g/ f/e/f/g/ f/a/g/f/ | ef g/f/e/d/ c2e2 |!\nd/c/B/A/ B/A/G/F/ G/F/E/D/ Dg | fga de d2 D2 ||!\nDEDg f/g/a/ df|e/f/ g/f/e/d/ c2e2 |DEDg f/g/a/ df |!\na/g/a/b/ a/b/a/g/ f2a2 | g/f/g/a/ a/c'/a/g/ f/e/f/g/ f/a/g/f/ |!\ne/d/e/f/ g/f/e/d/ c2e2 |d/c/B/A/ B/A/G/F/ G/F/E/D/ Dg |\\\nfga df d2 D2 :|!\n|:  a/f/d/f/ d/f/a/f/ a/f/d/f/ d/f/a/f/|\\\ne/d/e/f/ g/f/e/d/ c2 e2|\\\na/f/d/f/ d/f/a/f/ a/f/d/f/ d/f/a/f/| a/g/a/b/ a/b/a/g/ f2a2 |!\ng/d/B/d/ B/d/g/d/ e/c/A/c/ A/c/e/c/| e>f g/f/e/d/ c2e2 |\\\nd/c/B/A/ B/A/G/F/ G/F/E/D/ Dg |\\\nf/g/a/ de d2 D2 |]"
