    "abc": "X:46\nT:More for Beauty than(?) Gear. JBa.45\nM:4/4\nL:1/8\nQ:1/4=120\nS:Joseph Barnes MS,Carlisle,1762.\nR:Country Dance\nO:England\nA:North-West - Carlisle\nN:I don't know what key signature to choose It seems to vary between 5/4\nN:and 7/4. Or so. 1 - written over this bar is and the bar is\nN:written a note above the transcription, so it has been written a note\nN:down..CGr...I,ve had a go at this, but beware that it is only my\nN:guess..CGP.\nH:See Paul's notes.\nZ:vmp.C.Graebe.\nB:Village Music project, Barnes, Joseph\n%%Mirrorred-From:http://www.village-music-project.org.uk/abc/barnes_j.abc\nK:C major\n\nd2 (3(fga) f2d2 (fg)(af) | d2 (fga) e2c2 (ef)(ge) |!\nd2 (fga) f2d2 (fg)(af) | g2 (ag)f2 (gf) | ec (ef)(ge)||!\nfd Ad fd (fg)(af) | fd Ad ec (ef)(ge) |!\nfd Ad fd (fg)(af) |g2 (ag) f2 (2(af) e2c2 (ef)(ge) ||!\nd2 a2 (fg)(af) ad (fg)(af) |d2 a2 (fg)(af) ec (ef)(ge) | !\nd2 a2 fgaf ad (fg)(af) | g2 (ag) f2 (gf) ec efge ||!\nzzzz|zzzz||!\n\nM:4/4\nd2 (f/g/a) fd (f/g/)(a/f/) | d2 (f/g/a) ec (e/f/)(g/e/) |!\nd2 (f/g/a) fd (f/g/)(a/f/) | g(a/g/) f(g/f/)  ec (e/f/)(g/e/)||!\nfd Ad fd (f/g/)(a/f/) | fd Ad ec (e/f/)(g/e/) |!\nfd Ad fd (f/g/)(a/f/) |g(a/g/) f(a/f/) ec (e/f/)(g/e/) ||!\nda (f/g/)(a/f/) ad (f/g/)(a/f/)|da (f/g/)(a/f/) ec (e/f/)(g/e/)|!\nda (f/g/)(a/f/) ad (f/g/)(a/f/) | g(a/g/) f(g/f/) ec (e/f/)(g/e/) |]"
