    "abc": "X:8\nT:Marey Ramsay,unedited. BF12.08\nM:2/2\nL:1/8\nQ:1/4=100\nS:MS12,J.Wilson,1833,Browne Coll.,Lakes\nR:Reel\nO:England\nA:North-West - Lake District\nN:The time signature is an illegiable squiggle, but 2/2 seems to make\nN:sense.  The key signature is sharps on top space and middle line. (E\nN:and B).  The photocopy is a little difficult to read\nZ:vmp.Cherri Graebe.\nB:Village Music project, Browne 12\n%%Mirrorred-From:http://www.village-music-project.org.uk/abc/browne12.abc\nK:D major\n\nD2B2AFF|BAFd BAFF|D2B2 AFFA|(Bcd) A2F2|EE/2E/2 E2:|!\n|:fddf|ecce|d2B2B2d2BFF|efdd e2c2c2|(Bcd) AF E2|!\nefdd fecc|dBB d2 AFFA|dfce B2|A2F2|G2B2A2F2|EEEE2:|"
