    "abc": "X:6\nT:Boniest(!) Lass In The World. BF14.05\nM:4/4\nL:1/8\nQ:1/4=100\nS:MS14,Browne ,early 19thC,Troutbeck,W'morland\nR:Air\nO:England\nA:North-West - Lake District\nN:Okay,it's not actually a very obvious word to spell!. Bony,Bonny, vive\nN:la difference!.CGP\nZ:vmp.Chris Partington\nB:Village Music project, Browne14\n%%Mirrorred-From:http://www.village-music-project.org.uk/abc/browne14.abc\nK:G major\nGA|BDEG cBAG|E2DEG2g2|degd  e4d2 ef|!\ngfed efgB|cBAG E2(DE)|G2g2decd|B2AGG2:|!\n|:ef|gfed efge|agfe fgaf|gfga bgab|e4d2ga|!\nbage degB| cBAGE2DE| G2g2decd|B2AG G2|]"
