    "abc": "X:73\nT:50th Psalm. WHG.072\nR:Hymn\nS:W.H.Giles MS,Bampton,Oxfordshire,1839p73\nO:England\nH:donated by Mrs W.R.Kettlewell to VWML,Apr 1927.\nA:Oxfordshire - Bampton\nN:The d2 in bar4 is d in the MS. The A just before \nN:is A2 in the MS. The a2 under  is a in the MS.\nZ:PJHeadford - VMP 2009\nM:C|\nL:1/8\nQ:2/4=70\nB:Village Music project, Giles, William\n%%Mirrorred-From:http://www.village-music-project.org.uk/abc/gileswh.abc\nnotC:by Thos. Clark\nK:D major\nA2|d2d2 d2zf|g2e2 f2zf|e2d2 a3f|e2e2d2zf|\\\nfe ed dc cB|A2^G2 A2zA|A2A2 A2zd|d2=c2 B2zB|\ne2g2 f2e2|d2c2 B2zA|AF GB Ad fa|g2f2 Hezd|\\\nce A2 d2g2|f2e2 d2||a2|afdb afd/e/f/g/|\\\nf2e2 d2|]"
